  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e373bcb8-30a0-49e3-b116-ed018b146c9e",
    "name": "RentNest Backend API Collection (Complete v2.0)",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for the RentNest rental property marketplace REST API.\n\n**Environments & Base URLs:**\n- `{{devBaseUrl}}`: `http://localhost:8080`\n- `{{prodBaseUrl}}`: `https://rent-nest-backend.vercel.app`\n\n**Auth:**\n- Use `/api/auth/login` or `/api/auth/google`. The API sets httpOnly `accessToken` and `refreshToken` cookies.\n- For header-based auth, provide `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n**Roles:**\n- `TENANT`: Search properties, submit rental requests, Stripe checkout & payment sync, favorites wishlist, leave reviews.\n- `LANDLORD`: Create/manage listings, approve/reject rental requests, view earnings dashboard.\n- `ADMIN`: Manage users, moderate listings, view global financial stats, contact submissions, newsletter subscribers, categories.\n\n**Demo Credentials:**\n- Admin: `admin@rentnest.com` / `admin123`\n- Landlord: `landlord@rentnest.com` / `Demo@1234`\n- Tenant: `tenant@rentnest.com` / `Demo@1234`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "31457961"
  },
